observation|Watching process and noticed remark have distinct ordinal support and countability. Bird arrival and sign relocation examples align in Vietnamese without conflating remarks with scientific proof.
thirteen|Number is exactly twelve plus one, and thirteen chairs is plural. Both languages preserve the same count; new scoped NUMBER parsing is editorial only, with canonical classification still unresolved.
write|Text formation/composition allows handwriting and typing without narrowing to one tool. Key-location note translates faithfully; wrote/written irregular forms and recipient to checked.
accident|Unwanted damaging event and fortunate chance are separate meanings. One-hour road blockage and happy meeting preserve harm versus luck, rather than treating all accidents as injuries.
federal|Central/constituent authority sharing is distinguished from arbitrary national government, correcting overly broad source evidence. Fictional civics comparison avoids current political or legal claims; Vietnamese liên bang is accurate.
